---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---
<PolicyLayout
  title="Acceptable Use Policy"
  description="The rules for using Ballmecca safely and respectfully, including our youth-safety standards and how to report abuse."
  path="/acceptable-use"
>
  <h1>Acceptable Use Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-muted last-updated">Last updated: July 3, 2026</p>
  <p>This Acceptable Use Policy is part of our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> and applies to everyone who uses Ballmecca. Because our community includes young athletes, keeping the Services safe is a priority. Your continued use means you accept this Policy.</p>

  <h2>Prohibited conduct</h2>
  <p>When using the Services, you must comply with all applicable laws and this Policy. You may not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Harass, bully, threaten, defame, or discriminate against any person</li>
    <li>Post or share obscene, sexual, violent, hateful, or otherwise objectionable content</li>
    <li>Share another person's private or personal information without permission, or record or share images of others without their consent</li>
    <li>Impersonate any person or misrepresent your identity, credentials, or affiliation</li>
    <li>Defraud or mislead us or other users, or circumvent fees or transact off-platform to avoid them</li>
    <li>Systematically harvest data or content, or collect usernames or email addresses for unsolicited messages</li>
    <li>Circumvent, disable, or interfere with security features, or upload malware or otherwise disrupt the Services</li>
    <li>Use the Services for any unlawful purpose or to infringe others' intellectual-property rights (see our <a href="/dmca">DMCA</a> policy)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Protecting minors — zero tolerance</h2>
  <p>We have <strong>zero tolerance</strong> for the sexual exploitation of, or any harm to, children. You must never:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Produce, share, request, or solicit child sexual abuse material (CSAM) or any sexual content involving a minor;</li>
    <li>Groom, sexually solicit, or attempt to develop an inappropriate relationship with a minor;</li>
    <li>Solicit or arrange off-platform or in-person contact with a minor, or request a minor's private contact information.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Coaching of minors must take place on the Services. We report apparent child sexual exploitation to the National Center for Missing &amp; Exploited Children (NCMEC) and cooperate with law enforcement.</p>

  <h2>Reporting and enforcement</h2>
  <p>You can report a user, message, or content, and block another user, within the Services or by emailing <a href="mailto:support@ballmecca.com">support@ballmecca.com</a>. We review reports and take action we consider appropriate — which may include removing content, and warning, suspending, or terminating accounts. We may act on violations with or without notice and cooperate with law enforcement where appropriate.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
